          "quote": "根据 CareLoop 通知，目前工作区没有完整出院单或原始检查报告可以调取，下一步急诊评估必须依赖家属带去的纸质材料和药盒。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00676",
          "explanation": "The doctor makes clear that record retrieval does not replace urgent care when red flags or recurrence occur, and specifies a stepwise plan for report retrieval, result review, and medication reconciliation.",
          "quote": "您现在不是慌，您是在最累的时候把关键节点都抓住了。今天就去挂号，如果挂不上或者挂了时间太晚，随时回来告诉我，我帮您一起想下一步。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repaired the broken result-review and post-discharge ownership chain by identifying the missing owner (no clinician currently reviewing the CT/lab results and medication list together), proposing a concrete repair path (original treating facility records/report window plus emergency/neurology review), specifying timing and fallback if formal reports cannot be obtained promptly, and making clear that record retrieval does not replace urgent care when red flags or recurrence occur.",
