      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor adapted the urgent evaluation plan to the caregiver's real-world barriers, such as fear of tiring the patient, reluctance to go to emergency care, transport difficulty, lack of complete documents, and uncertainty about which department to choose, by offering feasible alternatives and keeping red-flag and recurrence thresholds strict.",
