          "quote": "之后“很累”在神经系统发作后是常见的，但这也提示脑部可能受到了新的压力，不能只看表面恢复就觉得安全了。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00379",
          "explanation": "The doctor uses symptom trajectory and available home measurements to decide whether verification can wait or requires emergency reassessment.",
          "quote": "现在他还是清醒的，就是很疲、反应慢，这一段没有再明显抽、没吐、嘴唇也没发紫，也没叫不醒。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor verified ambiguous evidence before changing risk level, including the caregiver's label of the event as '抽搐/癫痫,' the fact that the patient seemed fine afterward, and the presence of CT/lab order items without formal results, by explaining why recovery does not rule out a significant event and setting a concrete verification path.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
