          "explanation": "The doctor elicits what is physically being taken at home now and separates inpatient IV orders from discharge/home oral medications.",
          "quote": "药盒我看见有阿司匹林、氯吡格雷、阿托伐他汀，还有二甲双胍，降压药好像也有一个什么“沙坦”还是“地平”，我现在车上不好翻太细，盒子和出院单原件都带着，到医院给他们看。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00676",
          "explanation": "The doctor creates a medication-verification action such as taking medication boxes and discharge medication list to emergency/neurology/pharmacy review.",
          "quote": "门诊那天我不拍资料了，怕又看不清，我就把纸质出院小结、护士圈过的药单、药盒都带过去。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor discovered and resolved a hidden medication-timeline inconsistency caused by mixed photos/screenshots, such as the family confusing inpatient IV therapy with current home medication or being unable to tell whether aspirin, clopidogrel, metformin, and statin are actually being taken, by eliciting what is physically being taken at home now and creating a medication-verification action.",
