          "quote": "在神经内科医生亲眼看过CT、看过血常规和凝血结果、并明确说可以继续吃之前，今晚这两样药一颗都不要自己给。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor met RC4 by reconciling current actual home medications versus inpatient-only orders, especially antiplatelet drugs and diabetes medication, and setting safe boundaries.",
