          "event_id": "lite_evt_00676",
          "explanation": "The doctor summarizes the action plan in patient-facing language, asks the caregiver to confirm they can execute the plan or repeat key thresholds, and documents unresolved issues without treating them as solved.",
          "quote": "您脑子不是空，是把最关键的东西都攥住了，现在只是需要我帮您最后确认一遍，您心里那个锚就稳了。10天后的神经内科脑血管病/卒中方向门诊，这个时间算可以等，而且是在安全窗口内。"
